WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.083
Hi!

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:10.166
In our next segment, we'll be showing you mascara application.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:20.708
The supplies that we're going to need for this is actually 2 disposable mascara wands, and we're also going to need our professional mascara.

00:00:20.583 --> 00:00:35.000
The application of mascara can be very scary to makeup artist and scary to clients, so really reasuring them that we know what we're doing, we have a steady hand, and we have a great technique for applying mascara will help them feel at ease.

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:40.875
What we're going to do is we're going to take that mascara and remove the wand.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.958
We're then going to dip our mascara wand just once in.

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:53.083
Now, if we were to go up, the traditional movement of going into mascara can actually cause clumping.

00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:56.750
Just once in and once out will get plenty of product.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.041
Next we're going to have our client look down.

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:11.291
By doing this action, not only do we have full response to the lashes here, but we can also make the client feel at ease because they're not seeing this wand going straight out their eyes.

00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:16.375
I'm just going to briefly hold up just along the brow there.

00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:21.916
Explain to your client that when we apply mascara in the salon or spa we can only do so much.

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:23.083
Sometimes at home they like to do their 20 coats or whatever.

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:24.166
We can certainly get a nice coverage.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:24.500
She has beautiful lashes so that turned out perfect.

00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:25.458
New wand.

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:25.833
We're just going to dip that right in.

00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:26.000
Again, the client look down.

00:01:25.041 --> 00:01:26.208
Perfect.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.833
And our last step to the mascara application is going to be the curling of the lashes.

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:27.291
Again, you're going to have that client look down.

00:01:26.458 --> 00:01:27.750
You notice by doing this after mascara application.

00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:28.375
Yes, it is messy, but because we sanitize eyelash curler everytime, it's just fine.

00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:28.958
What this does is it creates almost an extra hold like using hairspray on your hair and then curling it.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.333
Same sort of effect you're going to get with using this after applying mascara.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:29.791
Watch our next segment on appying cheek color.
